ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796510/extras/5f125b613d94467aa804728acb90829e.poster.avif?t=1735232741\" width=638 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796510/extras/5f125b613d94467aa804728acb90829e.webm?t=1735232741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796510/extras/5f125b613d94467aa804728acb90829e.mp4?t=1735232741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796510/extras/e9f213b3b8a0245b15845f0d411dad17.webp?t=1735232741\" width=308 height=23 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate a retro over-world map</strong> as you clear stages in a somewhat loose order that allows you to pick and choose your favorite game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find tents in the world map to <strong>unlock new playable characters</strong> that have distinct play styles ranging from completely defensive kits to kits focused on speed and critical hits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the coins you collect in stages at shops to <strong>buy permanent stat boosts or unlock shortcuts</strong> and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2796510/extras/af9ca4cbb8d046e3e3ecd48564702442.avif?t=1735232741\" width=673 height=108 /></span></p>",
